WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.120
Meet LetPot LPH home, a two-tier smart hydroponic growing system.

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.720
They couldn't grow food at home until one day something arrived.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:20.240
LetPot LPH home is quick and easy to set up. Premium wood pieces fit together, everything simple.

4
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.860
Now pick your favorite seeds with no weird subscriptions, your choice, your way.

5
00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.620
That part and we did it.

6
00:00:30.740 --> 00:00:33.300
And once it's all set, let the magic grow.

7
00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:41.580
With two independent growing zones, every plant gets exactly what it needs.

8
00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:44.300
Tomatoes up top with room to grow tall.

9
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.460
Herbs and greens down below, 32 spots, all yours to fill.

10
00:00:49.260 --> 00:00:55.100
Two separate tanks and two full spectrum lights, 36 and 24 watts.

11
00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:57.500
Cool light for fresh greens and herbs.

12
00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.780
Warm light for fruits and tomatoes.

13
00:01:00.780 --> 00:01:04.780
Each zone monitors its own water, temperature and nutrients,

14
00:01:04.780 --> 00:01:08.060
so every plant gets its own care all at once.

15
00:01:08.060 --> 00:01:13.180
A built-in water pump keeps everything flowing, feeding your roots day and night.

16
00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:17.260
And the telescopic light pole adjusts to your plants.

17
00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:21.340
Start it low for tiny seedlings, then raise it as they grow.

18
00:01:21.340 --> 00:01:26.300
So every leaf gets the perfect light, smooth wills let you roll it anywhere.

19
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.500
Its warm wood design adds beauty to your home,

20
00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:33.340
while the smart touch screen makes everything simple to monitor.

21
00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:36.060
With the LetPot app, you stay in control.

22
00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:39.740
Going on vacation, just turn on vacation mode,

23
00:01:39.740 --> 00:01:41.980
and your garden keeps growing while you're away.

24
00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.340
Each tank is easy to clean, just rinse with water, and you're done.

25
00:01:47.980 --> 00:01:49.980
Guys, let's make dinner coming.

26
00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:54.380
And just like that, the family had a beautiful little harvest of their own.

27
00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:57.500
Fresh herbs and ripe tomatoes for every meal,

28
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:01.980
and with every bite, sweet memories of grandfather's garden came rushing back.

29
00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:08.380
Let pot LPH home, a smart garden for everyday life.

30
00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.300
Back us on Kickstarter!
